---
source: crates/navree-orm/tests/sql/main.rs
expression: "rows(table(\"companies\").select([\"name\"]).union(table(\"deals\").select([\"title\"])).union_all(table(\"users\").select([\"name\"])))"
---
PostgreSQL: SELECT "name" FROM "companies" UNION (SELECT "title" FROM "deals") UNION ALL (SELECT "name" FROM "users")
MySQL: SELECT `name` FROM `companies` UNION (SELECT `title` FROM `deals`) UNION ALL (SELECT `name` FROM `users`)
SQLite: SELECT "name" FROM "companies" UNION SELECT "title" FROM "deals" UNION ALL SELECT "name" FROM "users"
